        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\"label\":\"embed-2\",\"action\":\"get_settings\",\"result\":[{\"status\":\"success\",\"message\":\"Settings retrieved\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"all_raw_settings\",\"total_matches\":4,\"matches\":[{\"key\":\"domId\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"key\":\"visibility\",\"value\":true},{\"key\":\"code\",\"value\":\"<div class=\\\"pmc-results\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"pmc-results-tabs\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"pmc-results-tab is-active\\\" data-result=\\\"result-arete\\\">Arete Athletics</button>\\n    <button class=\\\"pmc-results-tab\\\" data-result=\\\"result-pf\\\">Philly Fades</button>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- PHILLY FADES -->\\n  <div id=\\\"result-pf\\\" class=\\\"pmc-results-slide\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"pmc-results-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"results-eyebrow\\\">Case Study (2022)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"results-title\\\">A barber shop that took over local search.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"results-client\\\">Philly Fades &middot; Full Local SEO</div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-results-story\\\">\\n        Philly Fades had the reputation but no digital presence. No rankings, no visibility, no system in place. I built their entire local SEO foundation from scratch - Google Business Profile, citation network, on-site optimization, and a review generation engine. Within 12 months they were dominating discovery search in one of the most competitive barber markets in Philly.\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <ul class=\\\"arete-services-list\\\">\\n        <li>Custom Website</li>\\n        <li>SEO Content Publishing</li>\\n        <li>Reputation Management &middot; Listings + Google Review Generation</li>\\n        <li>Google Business Profile Optimization + Posting</li>\\n      </ul>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-metrics-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">Phone Calls</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">1,213</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">+115% Year-over-year</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">Direct Searches</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">43,536</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">+262% Year-over-year</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">GBP Views</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">168,116</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">12-month total</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-report-area\\\">\\n        <figure class=\\\"pmc-report-item is-wide\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698f6b2d83529eb0de880884/69bb0a50ed4a4f9f19fb4cbc_pf-case-study-date.avif\\\"\\n               alt=\\\"Philly Fades local search and GBP visibility - 12 month sample\\\"\\n               class=\\\"sc-zoomable\\\" data-caption=\\\"Local Search &amp; GBP Visibility - Philly Fades\\\">\\n        </figure>\\n        <p class=\\\"arete-img-caption\\\">12-month sample (Jan 1 - Dec 31, 2022). Philly Fades dominating local search and GBP visibility across their market.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-results-quote\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote-text\\\">My Google Business Profile has been lighting up green for weeks. I'm guessing that's your work?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote-author\\\">&#8211; Mike Webb, Owner of Philly Fades</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- ARETE ATHLETICS -->\\n  <div id=\\\"result-arete\\\" class=\\\"pmc-results-slide is-active\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"pmc-results-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"results-eyebrow\\\">Case Study (2023)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"results-title\\\">From zero market share to owning the local pack.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"results-client\\\">Arete Athletics &middot; SEO &amp; Content Strategy</div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-results-story\\\">\\n        Arete had zero organic visibility when we started. No rankings, no content strategy, no technical foundation. I built the full SEO system - keyword targeting, content plan, on-site architecture, and local optimization. Within 12 months they went from invisible to holding the top position against Anytime Fitness, Planet Fitness, and every other competitor in their market.\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <ul class=\\\"arete-services-list\\\">\\n        <li>Custom Website</li>\\n        <li>SEO Content Publishing</li>\\n        <li>Reputation Management &middot; Listings + Google Review Generation</li>\\n        <li>Google Business Profile Optimization + Posting</li>\\n      </ul>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-metrics-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">Local Market Share</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">0&rarr;52%</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">In under 12 months</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">Organic Traffic</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">+571%</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">Year-over-year growth</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pmc-metric-card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-label\\\">Search Impressions</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-value\\\">19.1K</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric-context\\\">Google Search Console</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-report-area\\\">\\n        <figure class=\\\"pmc-report-item is-wide\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698f6b2d83529eb0de880884/69a75b10f0148d45f81fdd3b_screen-shot-2021-12-21-at-7.44.19-am.webp\\\"\\n               alt=\\\"Organic local search market share - Arete Athletics outranking Anytime Fitness and Planet Fitness\\\"\\n               class=\\\"sc-zoomable\\\" data-caption=\\\"Organic Local Search Rankings - Arete Athletics\\\">\\n          <figcaption class=\\\"pmc-report-cap\\\">Local Search Rankings</figcaption>\\n        </figure>\\n        <p class=\\\"arete-img-caption\\\">60-day sample (Nov 23, 2022 - Dec 21, 2023). Arete Athletics dominating organic local search - outranking Anytime Fitness, Planet Fitness, and every competitor in their market.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-results-quote\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote-text\\\">Joe made SEO simple, explained the why behind every move, and got us to the top for the keywords that mattered. The results didn't spike - they stuck.</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote-author\\\">&#8211; Sean Calhoun, Owner of Arete Athletics</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- Lightbox -->\\n<div class=\\\"sc-lightbox\\\" id=\\\"sc-lightbox\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sc-lb-close\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Close\\\">&times;</div>\\n  <img id=\\\"sc-lb-img\\\" src=\\\"\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sc-lb-caption\\\" id=\\\"sc-lb-caption\\\"></div>\\n</div>\"},{\"key\":\"attributes\",\"value\":[]}]}}]}"
